From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:10:35 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Apply loci-<gpu>-<param_size> naming convention across
 codebase
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Eliminates confusion between old Qwen 2.5 14B and current Qwen 3 14B
by standardizing on loci-rtx-14b / loci-arc-35b naming. Updates model
references, repo URLs (arko-sanyal2 → arko-sanyal-loci), and Arc GPU
status from pending to active (llama.cpp SYCL backend).

Files changed:
- config/gpu_allocation.json: correct models, endpoints, naming docs
- config/loci_rtx_14b.Modelfile: new Modelfile for Qwen 3 14B
- loci_engine/gpu_governor.py: model name, docstring, dynamic username
- architecture/unified_port_registry.md: diagram model names + Arc active
- systemd/loci-{sync,mcp}.service: repo URL to canonical org
- tests/test_agent_hub.py: test model name
- verify_substrate.sh: repo default to canonical org

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MV4Gz29XnVWE78geBBsguZ
